---
description: Red-green-refactor; failing test first; pytest / vitest exit gate
alwaysApply: true
---

# TDD

- No production code without a failing test first (red → green → refactor).
- Prefer pytest for Python; vitest for `web-client`.
- Mirror source under `tests/unit/` and `tests/integration/` (or colocated `*.test.ts`).
- Assert behavior and invariants; avoid trivial existence-only tests beyond smoke.
